<title>AUSTRIA: OECD details 1997, 1998 Austria forecasts.</title>
<headline>OECD details 1997, 1998 Austria forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Organisation for Economic Cooperation and Development on Thursday released the following economic projections to 1998.</p>
<p>(Percentage change from previous year unless noted)</p>
<p>						    '98     '97     '96</p>
<p> Private consumption			  1.7     0.5     1.4</p>
<p> Government consumption		     0.4     0.1     0.3</p>
<p> Exports of goods and services	    6.1     5.3     4.0</p>
<p> Imports of goods and services	    5.0     3.8     3.1</p>
<p> Gross domestic product (GDP)	     2.3     1.4     1.1</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)		   1.5     1.5     1.6</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)		    6.4     6.5     6.2</p>
<p> Short-term interest rate (pct)	   3.5     2.9     3.1</p>
<p> Long-term interest rate (pct)	    5.3     5.2     5.4</p>
<p>General govt budget balance,</p>
<p> pct of GDP				     -3.4    -3.0   -4.3</p>
<p> Current balance, pct of GDP		-1.1    -1.4   -1.8</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
